Description: Paladin login screen
 A LightDM greeter in the Paladin look: the white shield, everyone's picture,
 a password box, session choice and Sleep / Restart / Shut Down. It follows
 each person's Dark Mode choice and desktop picture. Makes LightDM the login
 manager; GDM stays installed, and removing this package switches back to it.
 If the Paladin greeter ever fails to start, LightDM's standard greeter is
 shown instead, so there is always a way to log in.
